# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository publishes hw4 ONLY.
#
# The working folder also contains hw1, hw2 and my-app, which are not part of
# this submission and must not be published. Rather than listing them (a new
# folder would silently escape that list), everything at the repo root is
# ignored by default and hw4 is explicitly allowed back in. A folder added here
# later is excluded until someone deliberately un-ignores it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
!/.gitignore
!/hw4/

# Belt-and-braces: these must never be committed from anywhere in the tree,
# even if a future allowlist entry would otherwise let them through.
# hw4/.gitignore repeats these for anyone who clones hw4 on its own.
**/data/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.env
.env.local
**/.env
**/.session_secret
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
.DS_Store
